# 统一文本文件的换行符为 LF，避免在 Windows / macOS / GitHub 网页端
# 之间来回编辑时产生「整文件都被修改」的噪音 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary

# GitHub 语法高亮
*.md   text
*.yml  text
*.html text
*.scss text
*.css  text
*.js   text

# GitHub 语言统计：压缩产物与第三方库不计入本项目源码
assets/js/*.min.js   linguist-generated=true
assets/js/plugins/** linguist-vendored
assets/js/vivus.js   linguist-vendored
